WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:06.580
Meet NexoLog, a management system connecting inventory,
orders and deliveries.

2
00:00:06.830 --> 00:00:12.470
Operations and their metrics come together in an organized
interface.

3
00:00:13.428 --> 00:00:19.716
The dashboard shows orders, order value, low stock and
pending shipments.

4
00:00:19.966 --> 00:00:26.590
Stock movements, recent orders and alerts help you monitor
daily operations.

5
00:00:27.512 --> 00:00:34.136
Each product has a category, brand, specification or
variant, and barcode.

6
00:00:34.386 --> 00:00:40.242
Stock balances, reservations and movements keep incoming
and outgoing goods under control.

7
00:00:41.178 --> 00:00:47.394
The Kanban board organizes orders into pending,
processing, shipped and delivered.

8
00:00:47.644 --> 00:00:53.380
Choose start and end dates to view a specific period while
preserving the full history.

9
00:00:54.303 --> 00:01:00.351
Tracking simulates the journey on a schematic map, with
automatic delivery stages.

10
00:01:00.601 --> 00:01:08.953
Events are saved and feed reports and the audit log. This
demonstration does not use live GPS.

11
00:01:09.887 --> 00:01:16.367
Suppliers are organized by category, contact, city and
status.

12
00:01:16.617 --> 00:01:22.809
Filters and a detail panel make it easier to find and
maintain supplier records.

13
00:01:23.762 --> 00:01:30.098
The customer area brings records, contact details and
metrics together on one screen.

14
00:01:30.348 --> 00:01:35.916
The list includes filters and internal scrolling to keep
information accessible.

15
00:01:36.845 --> 00:01:43.061
Reports show inventory turnover, fulfillment time and
order value by category.

16
00:01:43.311 --> 00:01:49.479
Select a period, export data and review the history of
actions performed in the system.

17
00:01:50.428 --> 00:01:56.284
User management controls roles, permissions and recorded
activities.

18
00:01:56.534 --> 00:02:04.286
The project combines React, FastAPI and SQLite to
integrate the interface, rules and persistence.

19
00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:12.420
The Windows version includes fictional transactions
spanning 2024 to 2026.

20
00:02:12.670 --> 00:02:21.286
Download the executable from the project card and choose
the demo login. NexoLog: your operation, connected.
